  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As we know, angular momentum is given by,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>L</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Torque is given by,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>&#964;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>&#964;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msup></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi>MLT</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>ML</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Also, Stress <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo></math> Pressure <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>F</mi><mi>A</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence, [Stress]&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>ML</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Pressure Gradient&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Therefore, [Pressure Gradient]<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>ML</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
